<import src="../../components/states.wxml"/><view class="page"><template is="feedback" data="{{loading,error}}"/><block wx:if="{{!loading && !error}}"><view class="eyebrow">KNOW YOURSELF A LITTLE BETTER</view><view class="heading">了解自己，从认真记录开始。</view><view class="notice section">档案仅自己可见。忌口会同步用于模拟食谱筛选，仍需自行核对真实食材。</view><view wx:if="{{!signedIn}}" class="card section"><button class="btn" data-url="/pages/account/index" bindtap="go">登录并确认城市</button></view><view wx:else class="card section"><view class="form-field"><text class="form-label">性别</text><picker range="{{sexes}}" value="{{sexIndex}}" bindchange="sex"><view class="picker">{{form.sex}} ⌄</view></picker></view><view class="grid2"><view wx:for="{{fields}}" wx:key="key" class="form-field"><text class="form-label">{{item.label}}</text><input class="input" type="digit" value="{{form[item.key]}}" data-key="{{item.key}}" bindinput="input"/></view></view><view class="form-field"><text class="form-label">忌口、偏好与过敏原</text><textarea placeholder="例如 花生、牛奶，用逗号分隔" value="{{restrictions}}" bindinput="restrictions"/><text class="caption">模拟匹配不能保证过敏安全，也不会替代专业饮食方案。</text></view><button class="btn" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="save">保存健康档案</button></view></block><view class="footnote">轻动 · 让健康成为一种日常</view></view>
